    "wclIdSpaceNote": "A Warcraft Logs combatantinfo talentTree entry is { id, rank, nodeID }. That `id` equals trait_data_t::id_trait_node_entry and `nodeID` equals trait_data_t::id_node is corroborated for Devourer on three real subjects: gtKb2xHn87pNcFfW fight 22 actor 32 and rXAfw9t1q8YpmkKD fight 13 actors 20 and 79. All 229 of their entries are pinned rows of class 12.",
    "applicabilityNote": "Not version-gated at runtime. CombatFight exposes no client-build key, so a gate against 12.1.0.69587 would always pass while appearing rigorous. A client build or talent-tree revision moving is a regeneration trigger for a human, not a runtime condition."
